{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09266","headline":"重九登滁城楼忆前岁九日归沣上赴崔都水及诸弟讌集凄然怀旧 · 韦应物","name":"重九登滁城楼忆前岁九日归沣上赴崔都水及诸弟讌集凄然怀旧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今日重九讌，去岁在京师。\n聊廻出省步，一赴郊园期。\n嘉节始云迈，周辰已及兹。\n秋山满清景，当赏属乖离。\n凋散民里阔，摧翳衆木衰。\n楼中一长啸，恻怆起凉颸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09266.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09266","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}